.SH NAME
QGCacheIterator \- An internal class for implementing QCacheIterator and QIntCacheIterator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qgcache.h>\fR
.PP
Inherited by QAsciiCacheIterator, QCacheIterator and QIntCacheIterator.
.PP
